{"closureRow":301,"acceptedOrdinal":322,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457924583425","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_daughtersfriend_1_1_0fddfd8","nodeNames":["phone_daughtersfriend_1_1"],"source":"Phone: Он... он тоже, что ли, был Гостем?","sourceSha256":"cd20a1b306e85aa7d14d5ce7097fb20be6aecc9ec9b6c9af2c1019b8a879b6e5","target":"Phone: Siya... Panauhin din ba siya?","components":["glossaryReferent","mandatoryRegression"]}
{"closureRow":302,"acceptedOrdinal":323,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457924583424","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_daughtersfriend_1_01bb092","nodeNames":["phone_daughtersfriend_1"],"source":"У меня тут девочка, у которой умер отец","sourceSha256":"295c40ca914c4fddad194b8f85e7079ed329e4727a9040d7e5165ab620e50947","target":"May kasama akong batang babaeng namatayan ng ama","components":["mandatoryRegression"]}
{"closureRow":303,"acceptedOrdinal":324,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457920389132","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_daughtersfriend_1_0d1c5a1","nodeNames":["phone_daughtersfriend_1"],"source":"Я хочу позвать вашу дочь к нам в гости. Её подруга просит","sourceSha256":"da50b9557d446322d5f94e622645a85ec44076b3346277101dec5a6aa95ece5d","target":"Gusto kong imbitahan ang anak ninyong babae sa amin. Hinihiling ito ng kaibigan niyang babae","components":["glossaryReferent","mandatoryRegression"]}
{"closureRow":304,"acceptedOrdinal":326,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457920389130","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_daughtersfriend_016cbd7","nodeNames":["phone_daughtersfriend"],"source":"Здравствуйте, пустите вашу дочь в гости поиграть с её подругой?","sourceSha256":"02ca067d40d259b14467c17b39b4ee7a8ca86324d90f420d772ca61e4d742634","target":"Magandang araw, puwede bang pumunta rito ang anak ninyong babae para makipaglaro sa kaibigan niya?","components":["glossaryReferent","mandatoryRegression"]}
{"closureRow":305,"acceptedOrdinal":327,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457920389129","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_daughtersfriend_065d61e","nodeNames":["phone_daughtersfriend"],"source":"Здравствуйте, можно поговорить с вашей дочерью?","sourceSha256":"9970611e61e3798863d859a911a662a07bdd842473bba5ca7dacef98dd1628b9","target":"Magandang araw, puwede ko bang makausap ang anak ninyong babae?","components":["glossaryReferent","mandatoryRegression"]}
{"closureRow":306,"acceptedOrdinal":336,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457920389120","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_phoneroulette_1_1_X_7_0897b68","nodeNames":["phone_phoneroulette_1_1_X_6"],"source":"Лучше бы он сгорел","sourceSha256":"e1d3c134c3652088631254f0cc0506fb6ec710ed1e4486491b215d281f2fe611","target":"Sana nasunog na lang siya","components":["mandatoryRegression"]}
{"closureRow":307,"acceptedOrdinal":340,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457916194824","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_phoneroulette_1_1_X_6_0df66fb","nodeNames":["phone_phoneroulette_1_1_X_5"],"source":"Теперь, всё что осталось от них, – это дом","sourceSha256":"a57ad277989f8189c2faf4131b9219ec04eba45f41ac451373ed848130d7ca24","target":"Ngayon, bahay na lang ang natitira mula sa kanila","components":["mandatoryRegression"]}
{"closureRow":308,"acceptedOrdinal":343,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457916194821","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_phoneroulette_1_1_X_4_0e2df08","nodeNames":["phone_phoneroulette_1_1_X_4"],"source":"И однажды я перестал быть для него сыном","sourceSha256":"2d1d1905939145e1d2b66c1a2b1e0303f03d46e9a7879334a7d7a8b7fe4113ea","target":"At isang araw, hindi na niya ako itinuring na anak na lalaki","components":["mandatoryRegression"]}
{"closureRow":309,"acceptedOrdinal":346,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457916194818","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_phoneroulette_1_1_X_3_087b76e","nodeNames":["phone_phoneroulette_1_1_X_3"],"source":"Мой отец… Я его ненавидел","sourceSha256":"863b2f1c85b16baec357302a110476c1d2e3ef0706c0bdb5eb7e864a2d36d003","target":"Ang ama ko… kinamumuhian ko siya","components":["mandatoryRegression"]}
{"closureRow":310,"acceptedOrdinal":349,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457912000520","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_phoneroulette_1_1_X_2_037c00b","nodeNames":["phone_phoneroulette_1_1_X_2"],"source":"Я… одинокий человек","sourceSha256":"00d18da31ab808e82d346001bbdf0a93210000559283b53bee83a773a7156c12","target":"Ako ay… malungkot at nag-iisa","components":["mandatoryRegression"]}
{"closureRow":311,"acceptedOrdinal":351,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457912000518","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_phoneroulette_1_1_X_2_018b454","nodeNames":["phone_phoneroulette_1_1_X_2"],"source":"Phone: Не переживайте, нет ничего страшного в том, чтобы рассказать о себе.","sourceSha256":"44076de22d16318b7ee3f5ecff4becb1a3b0e517a1ff7c67da08c7e18e5377c1","target":"Phone: Huwag kayong mag-alala, walang masama sa pagkukuwento tungkol sa sarili ninyo.","components":["mandatoryRegression"]}
{"closureRow":312,"acceptedOrdinal":352,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457912000517","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_phoneroulette_1_1_X_1_0df74ed","nodeNames":["phone_phoneroulette_1_1_X_1"],"source":"Я… одинокий человек","sourceSha256":"00d18da31ab808e82d346001bbdf0a93210000559283b53bee83a773a7156c12","target":"Ako ay… malungkot at nag-iisa","components":["mandatoryRegression"]}
{"closureRow":313,"acceptedOrdinal":356,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457912000513","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_phoneroulette_1_1_X_09d4a47","nodeNames":["phone_phoneroulette_1_1_X"],"source":"Я не привык говорить о себе…","sourceSha256":"f7f72503ae52ba5735786f5e0959c9f62225da04c9eaf323e521b46b8c7bb2c9","target":"Hindi ako sanay magsalita tungkol sa sarili ko…","components":["mandatoryRegression"]}
{"closureRow":314,"acceptedOrdinal":357,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457912000512","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_phoneroulette_1_1_X_03589d2","nodeNames":["phone_phoneroulette_1_1_X"],"source":"Phone: Что ж, теперь вы знаете немного обо мне. Теперь ваша очередь рассказать о себе.","sourceSha256":"1f8a88d78a288d8fae06317acd0e70fbe22814e8b90c8e2e4fad9d945c14ceda","target":"Phone: Buweno, may nalaman na kayo tungkol sa akin. Kayo naman ang magkuwento tungkol sa sarili ninyo.","components":["mandatoryRegression"]}
{"closureRow":315,"acceptedOrdinal":362,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457907806216","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_phoneroulette_1_1_X_0eee363","nodeNames":["phone_phoneroulette_1_1_X"],"source":"Phone: Я ждала, пока он признается в чувствах. Хотела, чтобы он сделал это первым. Но он всё не мог решиться, не мог подобрать момент.","sourceSha256":"b8b83f27ca127c5231729cd8e261ea147d44670c66a2708bc6940424f5d9ff2f","target":"Phone: Hinintay kong aminin niya ang nararamdaman niya. Gusto kong siya ang maunang magsabi. Pero hindi siya makapagpasya, hindi niya mahanap ang tamang sandali.","components":["glossaryReferent","mandatoryRegression"]}
{"closureRow":316,"acceptedOrdinal":364,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457907806214","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_phoneroulette_1_1_X_0e05821","nodeNames":["phone_phoneroulette_1_1_X"],"source":"Phone: Он так заботился обо мне. Всегда поддерживал, всегда готов был выслушать.","sourceSha256":"cf65c591606416dec570facd7061cfe914c46a6c0889a76fbad9fab5b8f572b4","target":"Phone: Lagi niya akong inaalagaan. Lagi niya akong sinusuportahan at handang makinig sa akin.","components":["mandatoryRegression"]}
{"closureRow":317,"acceptedOrdinal":365,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457907806213","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_phoneroulette_1_1_X_097eac5","nodeNames":["phone_phoneroulette_1_1_X"],"source":"Phone: Думаю, он был влюблён в меня.","sourceSha256":"ce1c5e36667351bf82dc2ef7af0490bcd3b0b0d17a6df5906ad8b53d33ce4ea2","target":"Phone: Sa palagay ko, umiibig siya sa akin.","components":["mandatoryRegression"]}
{"closureRow":318,"acceptedOrdinal":367,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457907806211","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_phoneroulette_1_1_4_07daece","nodeNames":["phone_phoneroulette_1_1_4"],"source":"Phone: Он хотел поехать со мной, но не смог. И я пообещала ему, что мы будем поддерживать связь, что позвоню ему. Но…","sourceSha256":"503513b0eb680040ab644ee2a447396b1c7d3b06cda220df7f82455048f02579","target":"Phone: Gusto niyang sumama sa akin, pero hindi niya magawa. Ipinangako kong patuloy kaming mag-uugnayan, na tatawagan ko siya. Pero…","components":["mandatoryRegression"]}
{"closureRow":319,"acceptedOrdinal":369,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457907806209","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_phoneroulette_1_1_4_074283c","nodeNames":["phone_phoneroulette_1_1_4"],"source":"Phone: Тоскую. Но скорее не по родному городу, а по людям, которые там остались…","sourceSha256":"2905efcd514e8c4aa31c4f971601c8bb1de2c2705b3042faeda932aac55bc1ce","target":"Phone: Nangungulila ako. Pero hindi gaanong sa aking bayan kundi sa mga taong naiwan doon…","components":["mandatoryRegression"]}
{"closureRow":320,"acceptedOrdinal":371,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457903611915","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_phoneroulette_1_1_3_0ad0bcf","nodeNames":["phone_phoneroulette_1_1_3"],"source":"Phone: Он так сокрушался об этом... Жалел, что не сделал их раньше. Я хотела помочь ему, но не знала, чем.","sourceSha256":"850ae029d551eba2aefb2e295df462c675de62477128cc764c1c140ebfbb2241","target":"Phone: Labis niya iyong ikinalungkot... Pinagsisihan niyang hindi niya inayos ang mga dokumento nang mas maaga. Gusto ko siyang tulungan, pero hindi ko alam kung paano.","components":["mandatoryRegression"]}
{"closureRow":321,"acceptedOrdinal":374,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457903611912","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_phoneroulette_1_1_3_097c7e1","nodeNames":["phone_phoneroulette_1_1_3"],"source":"Phone: У него не было документов, чтобы он мог отправиться в путь со мной.","sourceSha256":"f129f6ea33df726619b97af55a922d95bcdd70adc4221da332e0909dae0170fd","target":"Phone: Wala siyang mga dokumentong kailangan para makasama siya sa paglalakbay ko.","components":["mandatoryRegression"]}
{"closureRow":322,"acceptedOrdinal":379,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457903611907","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_phoneroulette_1_1_2_05eade3","nodeNames":["phone_phoneroulette_1_1_2"],"source":"Phone: Тоскую по спокойным временам, когда можно было просто жить и думать о будущем.","sourceSha256":"421e26555c6d989ae16780a53dbd13a142fd2e06fcdbdfe20ea5cd14982a3c88","target":"Phone: Nangungulila ako sa payapang mga panahong puwede pang mabuhay nang normal at mag-isip tungkol sa hinaharap.","components":["glossaryReferent","mandatoryRegression"]}
{"closureRow":323,"acceptedOrdinal":384,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457899417610","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_phoneroulette_1_1_2_053dee4","nodeNames":["phone_phoneroulette_1_1_2"],"source":"Phone: И позже я узнала, в чём причина, — у них отрубили телефонные линии.","sourceSha256":"57e156fab915a0227f274e542bb4599256603009c9e1fb5a5386a2c651ef9898","target":"Phone: Kalaunan, nalaman ko kung bakit—naputol ang mga linya ng telepono roon.","components":["mandatoryRegression"]}
{"closureRow":324,"acceptedOrdinal":388,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457899417606","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_phoneroulette_1_1_2_0072a36","nodeNames":["phone_phoneroulette_1_1_2"],"source":"Phone: Я бы с радостью им позвонила, но… Я не знаю, как мне с ними связаться…","sourceSha256":"1ab2d832729673467ed648a6c63beb064594406bb9eee18e8a277e951db6c074","target":"Phone: Gustung-gusto ko silang tawagan, pero… hindi ko alam kung paano ko sila makokontak…","components":["mandatoryRegression"]}
{"closureRow":325,"acceptedOrdinal":391,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457899417603","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_phoneroulette_1_1_1_0688e59","nodeNames":["phone_phoneroulette_1_1_1"],"source":"Phone: Ведь Гости могут никуда не пропасть. Заменить наших друзей и близких, а мы даже не узнаем об этом…","sourceSha256":"19da052ded117584bacfa8688a831f0fbf5aa3f73c4d15d6cb14497e36d7db89","target":"Phone: Baka hindi kailanman mawala ang mga Panauhin. Puwede nilang palitan ang mga kaibigan at mahal natin sa buhay nang hindi man lang natin malalaman…","components":["glossaryReferent","mandatoryRegression"]}
{"closureRow":326,"acceptedOrdinal":394,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457899417600","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_phoneroulette_1_1_1_0aad17e","nodeNames":["phone_phoneroulette_1_1_1"],"source":"Phone: Забавно, раньше я терпеть не могла холод, а сейчас… он – самая настоящая благодать для меня.","sourceSha256":"d971ad640cf6d9f393ed036f82ffc40b44cfda3e3465013c107adfe5aecc790b","target":"Phone: Nakakatawa, dati hindi ko matiis ang lamig, pero ngayon… tunay na biyaya ito sa akin.","components":["mandatoryRegression"]}
{"closureRow":327,"acceptedOrdinal":403,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457895223300","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_phoneroulette_1_1_0dad761","nodeNames":["phone_phoneroulette_1_1"],"source":"Phone: Думаю, чтобы нам было проще, я могу что-нибудь о себе рассказать.","sourceSha256":"8bf4ec5400b06193989f3f2b051edead0ed32df5653f117cebc9fd88ba39c1f8","target":"Phone: Para mas madali tayong makapag-usap, maaari akong magkuwento tungkol sa sarili ko.","components":["mandatoryRegression"]}
{"closureRow":328,"acceptedOrdinal":409,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457891029003","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_phoneroulette_1_019b6fb","nodeNames":["phone_phoneroulette_1"],"source":"Я не готов к долгому разговору","sourceSha256":"d1547367d2cbd824c67bd9e4987df3d6a691f15fa8e6ee92c712e41cd494433d","target":"Hindi ako handa sa mahabang usapan","components":["runtimeBinding"]}
{"closureRow":329,"acceptedOrdinal":410,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457891029002","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_phoneroulette_1_0a0bbdf","nodeNames":["phone_phoneroulette_1"],"source":"Хорошо","sourceSha256":"8379cddd92613f344c831a6dfcea07b82ea4fbfcfafe6798a3bbc8f6e1bbe85f","target":"Sige","components":["runtimeBinding"]}
{"closureRow":330,"acceptedOrdinal":411,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457891029001","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_phoneroulette_1_04ba42e","nodeNames":["phone_phoneroulette_1"],"source":"Phone: Вы не против послушать меня?","sourceSha256":"8e68f3b9e1ec8552cba35b836846d1664673d73ba5359ac471f8188bbb70be10","target":"Phone: Maaari ba ninyo akong pakinggan?","components":["runtimeBinding"]}
{"closureRow":331,"acceptedOrdinal":412,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457891029000","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_phoneroulette_1_09e182b","nodeNames":["phone_phoneroulette_1"],"source":"Phone: Вы не представляете, как поможете мне простым разговором. Так я буду чувствовать себя гораздо спокойнее.","sourceSha256":"005535caf9f7b1387a778dfd37943f94dd10549f1043d7aca9d4e2743b04a014","target":"Phone: Hindi ninyo alam kung gaano kalaking tulong ang simpleng pakikipag-usap ninyo sa akin. Mas mapapanatag ako.","components":["explicitContext","runtimeBinding","mandatoryRegression"]}
{"closureRow":332,"acceptedOrdinal":413,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457891028999","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_phoneroulette_1_0a55369","nodeNames":["phone_phoneroulette_1"],"source":"Phone: Я понимаю, что неправильно грузить неизвестного человека своими проблемами, но…","sourceSha256":"7c3ce60cf8b2bc39490814d991f2c60a001e810dad45888517ca38a1fbce9065","target":"Phone: Alam kong hindi tamang ibuhos ang mga problema ko sa isang hindi ko kilala, pero…","components":["explicitContext","runtimeBinding","mandatoryRegression"]}
{"closureRow":333,"acceptedOrdinal":414,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457891028998","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_phoneroulette_1_0b7172b","nodeNames":["phone_phoneroulette_1"],"source":"Phone: Возможно, не лучшее место, для изливания души, но лучше, чем ничего.","sourceSha256":"3ddee5f3de633f05be0173bc93ecb1d20787a61f0da7bb3e563ec1a129b442af","target":"Phone: Maaaring hindi ito ang pinakamainam na lugar para ilabas ang sama ng loob, pero mas mabuti na ito kaysa wala.","components":["explicitContext","runtimeBinding"]}
{"closureRow":334,"acceptedOrdinal":415,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457891028997","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_phoneroulette_1_08313e7","nodeNames":["phone_phoneroulette_1"],"source":"Phone: А потом я узнала про телефонную рулетку.","sourceSha256":"408db4d4b3e584c39b02f650e7afb6bceaff2bc0b5716f05937abddbd4558f9c","target":"Phone: At saka ko nalaman ang tungkol sa roleta sa telepono.","components":["runtimeBinding"]}
{"closureRow":335,"acceptedOrdinal":416,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457891028996","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_phoneroulette_1_027105b","nodeNames":["phone_phoneroulette_1"],"source":"Phone: Я пыталась связаться со своими друзьями и знакомыми, но никто не отвечает…","sourceSha256":"45f8b9cebdd5df573176853acb08cd57e09cd819b92fc1ba2b701bad48de9517","target":"Phone: Sinubukan kong tawagan ang mga kaibigan at kakilala ko, pero walang sumasagot…","components":["explicitContext","runtimeBinding"]}
{"closureRow":336,"acceptedOrdinal":417,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504457891028995","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:phone_phoneroulette_1_01c53e9","nodeNames":["phone_phoneroulette_1"],"source":"Phone: Я… Мне надо кому-то выговориться. Столько всего произошло за последнее время…","sourceSha256":"72566ed518867bcae41fde75504b150cd8df47256d9179950c5e81cb193adb95","target":"Phone: Ako… kailangan ko ng taong mapagsasabihan ng mga saloobin ko. Napakaraming nangyari nitong mga nakaraang araw…","components":["changed","exactSourceRepetition","runtimeBinding"]}
